descriptions.description:
&lt;h2&gt;Data Sources Summary&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;
This entry summarizes the data sources used for the paper 
&lt;b&gt;“Dyadic Interaction Platform: A novel tool to study transparent social interactions”&lt;/b&gt; 
published by &lt;i&gt;eLife&lt;/i&gt; 
(&lt;a href=&quot;https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.106757.1&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.106757.1&lt;/a&gt;).
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Original source:&lt;/strong&gt; 
&lt;a href=&quot;https://osf.io/8r6e2/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://osf.io/8r6e2/&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;hr&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Transparent Economic Games&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
The &lt;b&gt;BoS dataset&lt;/b&gt; described in this section and links to the GitHub code repositories are available at the public OSF repository:  
&lt;a href=&quot;https://osf.io/f5u8z&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://osf.io/f5u8z&lt;/a&gt;.
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Continuous Strategic Interactions&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;
    &lt;b&gt;Competitive Foraging task:&lt;/b&gt;  
    Data and code are available at  
    &lt;a href=&quot;https://osf.io/8r6e2/files/osfstorage&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://osf.io/8r6e2/files/osfstorage&lt;/a&gt;.
  &lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;
    &lt;b&gt;Cooperation–Competition Foraging study:&lt;/b&gt;  
    Data and code are available at the public OSF repository  
    &lt;a href=&quot;https://osf.io/56hw7&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://osf.io/56hw7&lt;/a&gt;.
  &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Perceptual Decision-Making in Dyadic Context&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
The data and code related to the &lt;b&gt;CPR DIP dataset&lt;/b&gt; are available here:  
&lt;a href=&quot;https://osf.io/8r6e2/files/osfstorage&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://osf.io/8r6e2/files/osfstorage&lt;/a&gt;.
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Attention and Social Learning&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
The dataset and code described in this section are available at the public OSF repository:  
&lt;a href=&quot;https://osf.io/6dven&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://osf.io/6dven&lt;/a&gt;.
&lt;/p&gt;
